  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "COL 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanene, kae abasomba baino ekere kia boronge, mokomanya ng’a nainwe more n’Omonene igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosorora",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mogenderere nogosaba, morende ase korokwo, na koiraneria ng’a mbuya mono;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gotosabera intwe boigo, erinde Nyasae atoigorere egesieri ase ring’ana riaye, erio tokwane obobisi bwa Kristo, naki nase engencho y’ayio nasibirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosabe ng’a mboorokie buna ngwenerete koboorokia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mogenderere ase obong’aini ase amasio ’abaanto abare isiko, na renda engaki yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Botambe chinkwana chiaino chibe chinyororo, chinywere buna omonyoo, erinde momanye buna mogwenerete koiraneria kera omonto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amakwania ’ogokoorera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Abaef 6:21-22)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukiko oyominto omwanchwa, omosomba omwegenwa, omosomba amo nainche ase Omonene, nabamanyie amang’ana aane onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namotomire ere ase more ase engencho eyio eyio, erinde momanye amang’ana aito, naende ere naremie chinkoro chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nere natomire Onesimo, oyominto omwegenwa, omwanchwa, oyore oyomo oino. Barabwo nabaabamanyie onsi ayare aiga ase tore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aristariko, oyosibetwe amo nainche, obakwanirie, na Mariko, omwana oisemoke Barnaba (mwanyorire ogotebererigwa igoro yaye; karaike seino momooroisie).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Yeso, oyokorokwa Yusto, obakwanirie. Abwo nabwo boka ase abaarogete bare abakori emeremo amo nainche ase engencho y’oborwoti bwa Nyasae; na barabwo nigo barenge kondemia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafara oyore oyomo oino, omosomba o Kristo Yeso, obakwanirie. Ere okorire omokia ase okobainyora ase ogosaba kwaye, erinde monyare gotenena more abaikeranu, abamanyete mono ogwancha gwonsi kwa Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki namobereire kirori, ng’a nare nomokia omonge mono ase engencho yaino, na ase engencho y’abwo bare Laodikia na Hieropoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luka, oria omogwenia omwanchwa, na Dema babakwanirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwanerie abaminto abare Laodikia, na Nimfa, na ekanisa ere ase enyomba yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riruube eri karirasomwe ase more, tiga risomwe naende ase ekanisa ya Laodikia; na riria rikorwa Laodikia risomwe ase more boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moteebie Arikipo arigererie mono obosomba boria aetwe korwa ase Omonene, erinde aboikeranie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nogokwania kwane, inche Paulo, ase okoboko kwane omonyene. Moinyore ebisibo biane. Obuya bobe amo nainwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
